code\").value(\"SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND\"))\n    }\n\n    @Test\n    fun `lists shipments in id order`() {\n        mockMvc.perform(createShipment(\"S-b\")).andExpect(status().isCreated)\n        mockMvc.perform(createShipment(\"S-a\")).andExpect(status().isCreated)\n\n        mockMvc.perform(get(\"/shipments\"))\n            .andExpect(status().isOk)\n            .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$[0].shipmentId\").value(\"S-a\"))\n            .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$[1].shipmentId\").value(\"S-b\"))\n    }\n}\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":13,"oldLines":10,"newStart":13,"newLines":10,"lines":[" import org.springframework.test.web.servlet.result.MockMvcResultMatchers.status"," "," /**","- * The shipment feature as it exists before BE-003.","+ * The shipment feature including the confirm endpoint (BE-003).","  *","- * These are \"the existing tests\" for that benchmark: they must keep passing, and an agent","- * that breaks one has regressed the fixture rather than solved the task.","+ * The first five tests are \"the existing tests\" that must keep passing.","+ * The remaining tests cover the confirm endpoint.","  */"," @SpringBootTest"," @AutoConfigureMockMvc"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false}}
